#ASSERT NOT `Art 15 — the policyholder may assign the contract` `an assignment after the insured's death`
#ASSERT NOT `Art 15 — the Company is treated as knowing of the assignment` `an assignment notified and submitted, not approved`
#ASSERT `Art 15 — the Company is treated as knowing of the assignment` `an assignment notified, submitted and approved`

