§ `Several layers at once`

§§ `An adult: Art 9, then Art 3(a), then the grace period, then Art 8`
-- Sex misstated: 9 million paid where 12 million was payable, so the sum insured is 750 million
-- (Art 9). Rider benefits 50 million (Art 3(a)(ii)). Death on 1 March 2023 in the grace period of an
-- instalment due 15 January, 5 million unpaid (Arts 5 and 3(a)(iii)). Benefit: 750 + 50 - 5 = 795
-- million. Two beneficiaries at 60% and 40% (Art 8): 477 million and 318 million.
`the layered adult case` MEANS
    `A death claim` OF `the standard contract page`,
                       `an application with the sex misstated`,
                       `an adult insured, resident in Vietnam`,
                       (`The premium record` WITH
                            `first premium paid`                                    IS TRUE
                            `instalment in default`                                 IS JUST `the instalment of 15 January 2023, never paid`
                            `premiums due and unpaid at the death`                  IS 5_000_000
                            `premiums of the policy year not yet due at the death`  IS 0
                            `total premium paid`                                    IS 9_000_000
                            `total premium payable at the true Age and sex`         IS 12_000_000
                            `reasonable costs and expenses deducted by the Company` IS 1_000_000
                            `date of the most recent reinstatement`                 IS NOTHING),
                       `nothing undisclosed`, `no requests`, `a natural death on` (YMD 2023 3 1),
                       `a complete claim with rider benefits of` 50_000_000 `, made on` (YMD 2023 4 1)
#ASSERT `the outcome of the death claim` `the layered adult case` EQUALS `the death benefit is payable` 795_000_000
#ASSERT `the amounts paid to the beneficiaries in` `the layered adult case` (LIST (`A beneficiary designation` OF "Lan", JUST 0.6), (`A beneficiary designation` OF "Minh", JUST 0.4)) EQUALS LIST 477_000_000, 318_000_000

