-- billion (Art 3(b)). Riders 50 million. An instalment due 1 November 2023 is unpaid, 2 million;
-- its grace runs to 31 December 2023 (30 + 30 days). The record says the insured signed the
-- application (finding 10 is about whether a child can). Benefit: 600 + 50 - 2 = 648 million.
