                       `a signed application`,
                       `a resident insured born on` (YMD 2021 3 1),
                       (`The premium record` WITH
                            `first premium paid`                                    IS TRUE
                            `instalment in default`                                 IS JUST (`A premium instalment` OF YMD 2023 11 1, NOTHING, `paid to the Company`)
                            `premiums due and unpaid at the death`                  IS 2_000_000
                            `premiums of the policy year not yet due at the death`  IS 0
                            `total premium paid`                                    IS 4_000_000
                            `total premium payable at the true Age and sex`         IS 4_000_000
                            `reasonable costs and expenses deducted by the Company` IS 500_000
                            `date of the most recent reinstatement`                 IS NOTHING),
                       `nothing undisclosed`,
                       (`The policyholder's requests` WITH
                            `date the contract was received`              IS YMD 2022 1 15
                            `date a written request to cancel was sent`   IS NOTHING
                            `date the policyholder requested termination` IS NOTHING),
                       `a natural death on` (YMD 2023 12 20),
                       `a complete claim with rider benefits of` 50_000_000 `, made on` (YMD 2024 1 5)
